{"ID":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","title":"9.7","type":"doc","updated":"20260907153639"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260907065734-fii4mk9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907065734-fii4mk9","updated":"20260907102345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Agent 的基本架构由哪些核心组件构成"}]},{"ID":"20260907065734-bm5bki7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907065734-bm5bki7","updated":"20260907065734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以把Agent系统比成一家公司：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"LLM是老板"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所有决策都经过它拍板\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"工具系统是外包执行团队"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，老板说指令，他们负责真正干活\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"记忆系统是公司档案室"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，各种信息的存档和调档都靠它\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"规划模块就是项目经理"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，拿到一个大项目后负责拆解成可执行的任务单\n四个角色各司其职，才撑起了Agent的自主运行能力"}]},{"ID":"20260907065734-mhj5t2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907065734-mhj5t2s","updated":"20260907065734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"注意："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n记忆分两层：\n短期记忆放在context Windows里，存当前任务的中间状态\n长期记忆用向量数据库实现，能跨任务保存用户偏好和历史，两者机制和用途完全不同"}]},{"ID":"20260907065734-wxchih0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907065734-wxchih0","updated":"20260907065734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模型本身不执行工具，它只是输出的决策，真正执行是你的代码，[决策和执行分离]"}]},{"ID":"20260907102345-zsrfh9x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907102345-zsrfh9x","updated":"20260907102345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Workflow，Agent，Tools 这三个的概念和区别介绍一下？"}]},{"ID":"20260907102345-9g9magk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907102345-9g9magk","updated":"20260907102345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tools是最小的能力单元，就是封装好的可调用函数，比如搜索、执行代码、发邮件，它只负责执行，本身没有任何决策能力\nAgent是一个完整的决策系统，内部用LLM做大脑，自己判断什么时候调哪个Tool、要不要继续、什么时候结束，是主动的\nWorkflow是更上层的编排框架，把Agent、LLM、Tools组织成一条确定性流程，每个节点做什么、按什么顺序流转都是开发者事先写死的"}]},{"ID":"20260907102345-a2kki86","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907102345-a2kki86","updated":"20260907105447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"什么是Multi-Agent"}]},{"ID":"20260907102345-969wzto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907102345-969wzto","updated":"20260907102345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多智能体系统就是多个Agent协作完成任务，每个Agent各有分工，有的负责搜索、有的负责写代码、有的负责做评审\n我理解的单个Agent主要受两个限制：\n一是context窗口大小，复杂任务信息量一多就撑爆了；\n二是单点能力，什么都让一个Agent做，每件事都是泛才。"}]},{"ID":"20260907102345-xxevh7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907102345-xxevh7p","updated":"20260907102345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Multi-Agent通过专业分工和并行执行，能处理更复杂、更长流程的任务\n多Agent协作模式：顺序流水线、并行扇出、辩论评审"}]},{"ID":"20260907105447-b716ek7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907105447-b716ek7","updated":"20260907110608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LangChain的底层架构与实现原理是什么"}]},{"ID":"20260907105447-ro93o1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907105447-ro93o1m","updated":"20260907105447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LangChain 是一套开源大模型应用开发库 (Python/JS)，本身不是大模型。它提供大量现成组件，帮你快速把 LLM、文档、向量库、工具组装成 AI 应用，不用从零手写全部胶水代码。"}]},{"ID":"20260907105447-bb32s8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907105447-bb32s8q","updated":"20260907105447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当前LangChain v1 更像一套面向Agent的分层开发框架，而不是将Prompt串起来的Chain工具。\n底层的langchain-coredin定义Message、Model、Tool和Runnable等标准协议\n不同厂商的独立集成包负责把自己的请求与响应适配到这些协议，\n因此应用层可以使用相对统一的方式切换模型和工具"}]},{"ID":"20260907105447-zre4a4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907105447-zre4a4w","updated":"20260907105447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在执行层，Runnable（“一个可以被执行的单元”）统一了组件的同步、异步、批处理和流式调用方式\n对于步骤固定的流程，可以使用LCEL组合Prompt、Model和Parser；\n对于需要模型自主选择工具的任务，则使用create_agent创建Agent。"}]},{"ID":"20260907105447-dowkzgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907105447-dowkzgm","updated":"20260907105447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"create_agent会把模型节点和工具节点编译成LangGraph状态图\n模型读取消息后生成AIMessage；如果其中包含tool_calls,运行时执行对应工具，并把结果包装成带相同调用ID的ToolMessage写回状态；模型再次读取工具结果并继续判断，直到生成最终回答。"}]},{"ID":"20260907105447-4w4q62y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907105447-4w4q62y","updated":"20260907105447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在这套架构中，State 保存会变化的消息与业务状态，Runtime 提供可信上下文和长期 Store，Middleware负\n责在模型或工具调用前后加入权限、重试、摘要与人工审批，LangGraph则负责路由、检查点、暂停恢复和长\n时间运行。\nLangChain 用标准协议统一组件，用create_agent 提供高层 Agent 入口，再由 LangGraph 承担有状态的\n执行运行时。"}]},{"ID":"20260907110608-momzsc1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907110608-momzsc1","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RAG与LLM WiKi机制+对比"}]},{"ID":"20260907110608-ngo43oq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907110608-ngo43oq","updated":"20260907110608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RAG=检索 增强 生成"}]},{"ID":"20260907110608-14x9yh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907110608-14x9yh0","updated":"20260907110608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"传统 RAG 属于"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"查询时检索"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的模式，文档入库只做切分、向量化保存原始碎片\n用户提问的时候，现场去"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"向量库召回相关文本块，把碎片塞给大模型生成回答"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对话结束知识"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不会沉淀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，每次提问都要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"重新检索拼接"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n优势是接入简单，适合大规模文档、原始原文检索\n缺点是容易出现碎片割裂，召回质量高度依赖切分和向量效果，跨文档综合推理比较弱"}]},{"ID":"20260907110608-meuezwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907110608-meuezwz","updated":"20260907110742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LLM‑Wiki 是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"预编译式的知识库范式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n（原始素材层、维基展现层、模式约定层）\n文档"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"录入阶段"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就交给"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大模型深度理解"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，提炼生成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"互相链接的 Markdown 维基页面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n还会处理观点冲突、维护实体关联，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"原始资料只做只读基准"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n后续用户提问，直接读取已经整理好的 Wiki 成品页面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不用再从原始文档切片检索"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n知识可以持续迭代沉淀下来GitHub"}]},{"ID":"20260907110608-eplq5mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907110608-eplq5mc","updated":"20260907110608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"二者最本质区别就是知识处理时机"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\nRAG 是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"查询时干活"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，输入输出用完就丢\nLLM‑Wiki 是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"摄入时干活"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，提前把知识加工完成\nRAG 适合海量业务文档、需要引用原文的场景\nLLM‑Wiki 更适合知识需要持续积累、做多概念综合推理的场景\n工程上两者也可以组合，RAG 负责召回原始素材，输出给 LLM‑Wiki 做知识库更新"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-vb1ys1c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-vb1ys1c","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"windbg-MCP服务"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-zyq34j2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-zyq34j2","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体部署架构图"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-anugmab","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-anugmab","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"graph LR\n    ai[\"AI 客户端\u003cbr/\u003eCursor / Claude / CodeBuddy\u003cbr/\u003e通过 MCP 调用调试工具\"]\n    script[\"自动化脚本\u003cbr/\u003e通过 REST API 调用\"]\n    browser[\"浏览器用户\u003cbr/\u003e打开轻量调试页面\"]\n    uploader[\"curl / HTTP 客户端\u003cbr/\u003e上传大文件\"]\n\n    server[\"CDB Analysis Server\u003cbr/\u003e单进程 ASGI 服务\u003cbr/\u003eStarlette + FastMCP + Uvicorn\"]\n\n    mcp[\"/mcp\u003cbr/\u003eMCP Streamable HTTP 入口\u003cbr/\u003e给 AI 工具调用\"]\n    api[\"/api/*\u003cbr/\u003eREST JSON 接口\u003cbr/\u003e给脚本和网页调用\"]\n    web[\"/cdb\u003cbr/\u003eWeb 调试页面\u003cbr/\u003e给人工用户使用\"]\n    upload[\"/uploads/{token}\u003cbr/\u003e一次性上传入口\u003cbr/\u003e接收 dump 和 symbol 文件\"]\n    status[\"/status\u003cbr/\u003e服务状态查询入口\"]\n\n    cdb[\"cdb.exe\u003cbr/\u003eWindows 调试器命令行程序\"]\n    symstore[\"symstore.exe\u003cbr/\u003e符号索引工具\"]\n    disk[\"data_dir 数据目录\u003cbr/\u003edumps / user_pdbs / pdb_cache / tmp\"]\n\n    ai --\u003e mcp\n    script --\u003e api\n    browser --\u003e web\n    uploader --\u003e upload\n    mcp --\u003e server\n    api --\u003e server\n    web --\u003e server\n    upload --\u003e server\n    status --\u003e server\n    server --\u003e cdb\n    server --\u003e symstore\n    server --\u003e disk"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-hrjapkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-hrjapkz","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码分层架构图\n\n"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-3ys8gfr","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-3ys8gfr","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"graph TB\n    entry[\"Entry 入口层\u003cbr/\u003emain.py（应用组装和启动）\u003cbr/\u003e__main__.py（python -m 入口）\"]\n\n    tools[\"Tools MCP 工具层\u003cbr/\u003etools/upload_tools.py（上传和查询工具）\u003cbr/\u003etools/cdb_tools.py（一次性 CDB 执行工具）\u003cbr/\u003etools/session_tools.py（交互式会话工具）\"]\n\n    api[\"API HTTP 接口层\u003cbr/\u003eapi/rest_api.py（REST JSON 接口）\u003cbr/\u003eapi/upload_endpoint.py（大文件上传接口）\u003cbr/\u003eapi/cdb_web.py（网页调试界面）\u003cbr/\u003eapi/auth.py（Bearer Token 鉴权中间件）\"]\n\n    core[\"Core 核心引擎层\u003cbr/\u003ecore/file_manager.py（文件和符号管理）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/session_manager.py（CDB 会话池管理）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/cdb_session.py（单个 CDB 子进程封装）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/output_parser.py（输出结构化解析）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/output_filter.py（输出清洗和截断）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/presets.py（预置分析组合）\"]\n\n    config[\"Config 配置层\u003cbr/\u003econfig.py（配置读取、目录派生、全局配置）\"]\n\n    external[\"外部程序和磁盘\u003cbr/\u003ecdb.exe（CDB 调试器）\u003cbr/\u003esymstore.exe（符号索引）\u003cbr/\u003edata_dir（dump 和符号缓存目录）\"]\n\n    entry --\u003e tools\n    entry --\u003e api\n    entry --\u003e core\n    entry --\u003e config\n    tools --\u003e core\n    tools --\u003e config\n    api --\u003e tools\n    api --\u003e core\n    api --\u003e config\n    core --\u003e config\n    core --\u003e external"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-gdsmu85","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-gdsmu85","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要文件以及调用关系"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-ebj75ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-ebj75ne","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"入口层"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nmain.py —— 总装车间：读命令行参数 → 造核心组件 → 注册 7 个 MCP 工具和 3 个提示词 → 拼路由表 → 套上鉴权和跨域 → 启动服务；顺便负责后台清理任务的启停"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-in5diu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-in5diu5","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"main.py —— 让你能用 python -m 启动，转头去调 main.py"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-hvllbev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-hvllbev","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"配置层"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nconfig.py —— 管配置的：命令行 \u003e 环境变量 \u003e yaml \u003e 默认值，一层层往上盖；顺带算出四个数据目录和符号搜索路径"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-eewn8px","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-eewn8px","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"工具层 Tools"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\ntools/upload_tools.py —— 管文件的：发上传令牌、从网址直接拉文件、查 dump 和会话状态"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-yw0thyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-yw0thyk","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"tools/session_tools.py —— 管会话的：开一个常驻 cdb 进程、自动摸清 dump 底细、在里面跑命令和预设、用完关掉"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-15qifxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-15qifxa","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"tools/cdb_tools.py —— 一次性执行：每次新起一个 cdb 进程，跑完就退（慢，大 dump 别用）"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-9c3i24o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-9c3i24o","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"接口层 API"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\napi/auth.py —— 守门的：核对请求带的口令，不对就拒"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-kj3h2vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-kj3h2vz","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"api/upload_endpoint.py —— 收文件的：大文件切成 8MB 小块边收边写盘，收完按类型归档"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-a572wyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-a572wyx","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"api/rest_api.py —— 给脚本用的 HTTP 接口，工具层能干的它都能干"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-396mz8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-396mz8a","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"api/cdb_web.py —— 给浏览器用的一个简易调试网页"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-xttz4co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-xttz4co","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"核心层 Core"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\ncore/session_manager.py —— 会话管家：最多养 15 个 cdb 进程；用线程池把慢活挪出主循环；能后台预载符号、定期回收发呆的会话"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-rtezdom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-rtezdom","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/cdb_session.py —— 管一个 cdb 进程：开后台线程盯着输出，用 UUID 标记把每条命令的输出切开，看到结束标记就通知"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-wy6etuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-wy6etuk","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/file_manager.py —— 管仓库的：按内容算 SHA1 存，重复的自动去重；PDB 上传后开后台线程做符号索引（加锁，一次只做一个）"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-d0v8pyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-d0v8pyh","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/output_filter.py —— 给输出洗澡：去掉调试器的废话、砍掉太长的内容、把进度条刷屏合并成一行"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-50wotxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-50wotxj","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/output_parser.py —— 把调试器吐的一大坨文本，解析成规整的 JSON"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-5vcs6p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-5vcs6p3","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/presets.py —— 8 个现成的分析套路，比如\"快速分诊\"\"异常详情\"，喊个名字就顶一串命令"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-hokl2bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-hokl2bl","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/disk_cleaner.py —— 磁盘清洁工：清临时文件、按水位淘汰老 dump（写好了，但还没接上）"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-d84z376","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-d84z376","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/metadata_store.py —— 记每个 dump 啥时候被用过，带锁保护，攒够一批再落盘"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-m9hw63x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-m9hw63x","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"外部\ncdb.exe —— 真正干活的调试器，最多同时开 15 个"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-on9pf7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-on9pf7a","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"symstore.exe —— 符号索引工具，同一时刻只跑一个"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-sqtjvkf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-sqtjvkf","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"data_dir/ —— 数据仓库：dumps 存 dump、user_pdbs 存用户上传的符号、pdb_cache 存符号缓存、tmp 存上传中的临时文件"}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-cg14gjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-cg14gjt","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"函数调用关系"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n三条主链："}]},{"ID":"20260907133618-0clyt1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907133618-0clyt1u","updated":"20260907133618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI 调试链 → main.py → /mcp → session_tools → session_manager（转线程池）→ cdb_session → cdb.exe，输出回流经 output_filter/output_parser/presets 处理后返回\n文件上传链 → upload_tools（发 token）→ upload_endpoint（流式落盘）→ file_manager（算 SHA1 归档，必要时起线程调 symstore.exe）\n脚本/浏览器链 → rest_api 或 cdb_web → 直接复用 tools/*.py → 回到链 1 或链 2\n依赖规则（单向无环）： Entry 依赖全部 → Tools/API 依赖 Core + Config → Core 只依赖 Config + 标准库 → Config 无内部依赖，Core 从不反向引用上层。"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-gh3pq8t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-gh3pq8t","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"c++ 编译器有哪些，为什么要有这么多编译器？"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-35e3xpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-35e3xpb","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常用的 C++ 编译器主要有 GCC/G++、Clang、MSVC、Intel C++ Compiler 等"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-lsxquda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-lsxquda","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之所以会存在这么多编译器，核心原因是不同平台、场景、需求需要对应的编译方案："}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-zewws1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-zewws1a","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GCC/G++ 广泛用于 Linux 等开源平台，兼容性强、生态成熟\nClang 编译速度快、报错清晰，在 macOS、iOS 开发和现代工程中流行\nMSVC 是 Windows 专属编译器，深度适配 Windows API 和 Visual Studio\nIntel 编译器则针对 Intel 硬件做了极致性能优化"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-v4tycbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-v4tycbj","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多编译器共存，本质是为了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"满足跨平台兼容性、编译效率、硬件优化、开发工具链适配等"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同场景的差异化需求\n让 C++ 能在各类系统和硬件上高效运行"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-ksxocsj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-ksxocsj","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"cpu 如何工作，讲讲具体的寄存器"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-s40gig2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-s40gig2","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 核心通过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"取指、译码、执行、写回"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"循环流水线工作"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，依靠时钟节拍持续运行\n所有运算数据不会直接操作内存，都会先加载到 CPU 内部寄存器\n寄存器是 CPU 速度最快的临时存储单元，保障运算效率"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-6vbvby8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-6vbvby8","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 寄存器分为几类核心功能寄存器"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-hd5nnxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-hd5nnxk","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"指令指针寄存器"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，记录下一条指令地址，控制程序顺序执行与跳转\n二是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"通用寄存器"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，负责存放运算数据、中间结果和函数参数，是日常计算的核心载体\n三是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"栈相关寄存器"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，管理函数栈帧、局部变量与函数调用现场\n四是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"标志寄存器"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，记录运算后的进位、零值、溢出等状态位，支撑条件判断、分支跳转逻辑\n还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"段寄存器"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用来划分代码段、数据段，配合完成内存地址寻址，整体协同完成程序完整运行"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-cjcpog3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-cjcpog3","updated":"20260907140624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"cpu 如何实现除法一反复减法"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-4r1y23b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-4r1y23b","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 最原始的除法，核心就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"反复减法实现"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n原理很简单，除法本质就是看被除数里面能包含多少个除数\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"每减一次除数，商就加一"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，直到剩下的数比除数小，不能再减为止，剩下的就是余数"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-cykgxsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-cykgxsb","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从硬件层面来说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CPU 内部只有加法运算单元，减法也是通过补码转成加法来做的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n做除法时会把被除数、除数放到寄存器，初始化商为 0，不断用被除数减除数\n只要结果不小于 0 就继续计数，一旦不够减就停止，最终计数就是商，剩余数值就是余数"}]},{"ID":"20260907140522-nn86hee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140522-nn86hee","updated":"20260907140522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种纯循环减法的除法方式逻辑最简单、电路好实现\n但缺点是速度很慢，数值越大循环次数越多\n所以现代 CPU 不会只用这种方式，而是采用移位除法、牛顿迭代等优化算法提速\n但底层最基础的除法思想还是源于反复减法"}]},{"ID":"20260907140624-u1hrlyv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907140624-u1hrlyv","updated":"20260907140936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 原子变量的内存模型你了解吗？"}]},{"ID":"20260907140624-ssdg14d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140624-ssdg14d","updated":"20260907140624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 原子变量内存模型，说白了就管两件事：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一是不让 CPU 随便乱排指令\n二是让一个线程改的值，其他线程能及时看见"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260907140624-y8huc4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140624-y8huc4g","updated":"20260907140624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一种，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"默认顺序一致"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n最简单粗暴，所有线程的操作大家看到的顺序都一模一样\nCPU 不许乱排指令，绝对安全\n但代价就是限制太多、CPU 跑着束手束脚，性能开销最大"}]},{"ID":"20260907140624-0zfhzsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140624-0zfhzsm","updated":"20260907140624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二种，宽松模型 relaxed\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"完全不管指令顺序，也不强制同步缓存，就只保证操作本身不会被中途打断"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n只适合单纯做计数器，好处是性能最快，坏处不能用来做线程间数据同步"}]},{"ID":"20260907140624-uho001u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140624-uho001u","updated":"20260907140624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三种，释放获取 release/acquire\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"折中最常用：\n写数据的地方加释放屏障，保证写之前的代码一定先跑完\n读数据的地方加获取屏障，保证读之后的代码一定后执行"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n既拦住了关键指令乱序，又不用像顺序一致那么笨重\n安全和性能兼顾，平时多线程同步基本都用它"}]},{"ID":"20260907140936-c8rk5dq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907140936-c8rk5dq","updated":"20260907141427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原子变量如何穿透 Cache 层级，让其他核可见？"}]},{"ID":"20260907140936-hsposx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140936-hsposx8","updated":"20260907140936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个 CPU 核心都有自己"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"私有的 L1、L2 缓存"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，相当于自己的小抽屉\n还有大家"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"共用的 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"L3 缓存和内存"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260907140936-e614m3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140936-e614m3e","updated":"20260907140936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"普通变量改完，就只放在当前核自己的小抽屉里\n不往外同步，别的核看不到新值"}]},{"ID":"20260907140936-r2shbe8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140936-r2shbe8","updated":"20260907140936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原子变量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不一样：\n一旦当前核修改原子变量，会立刻做两件事：\n第一，把自己抽屉里改好的数据，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"马上推到大家共用的 L3 和内存里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n第二，直接通知其他所有 CPU 核心，把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"他们抽屉里存的旧数据"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"作废"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260907140936-is0lbil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140936-is0lbil","updated":"20260907140936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其他核下次再读这个变量，自己抽屉里作废了，只能去公共区域拿最新的数据\n这样就穿透了每一层私有缓存，所有核都能立马看到最新值"}]},{"ID":"20260907140936-6u3bhi8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907140936-6u3bhi8","updated":"20260907140936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"原子变量要穿透缓存、立刻同步给所有核心，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"硬件必须强制把前后指令都卡住"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n不能乱排、不能延后\n正是因为要做缓存全局同步，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天然自带内存屏障"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n从而顺便就禁止了指令乱序、保证执行顺序不乱"}]},{"ID":"20260907141427-zszn05q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907141427-zszn05q","updated":"20260907141836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"编译加速怎么做？\t\t"}]},{"ID":"20260907141427-34m5kyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907141427-34m5kyl","updated":"20260907141427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"多线程并行编译"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如 make -j、Ninja、MSVC 的 /MP，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"直接利用多核"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，速度提升很明显"}]},{"ID":"20260907141427-2zh4o5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907141427-2zh4o5i","updated":"20260907141427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"然后用 ccache 做编译缓存，配合预编译头 PCH，避免重复编译，增量编译会快很多"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"–预编译头 PCH"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是把项目里经常用到、又基本不改的头文件，比如标准库、第三方库的头文件，提前单独编译好\n–编译缓存就是把之前编译过的文件结果存起来。下次代码没改动时，直接用缓存，不用重新编译，大幅加快增量编译速度"}]},{"ID":"20260907141427-2k7ftas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907141427-2k7ftas","updated":"20260907141427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码层面也会优化:\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"减少头文件依赖，多用前置声明，拆分大模块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n避免一处修改导致大量文件重新编译，减少不必要的编译开销\n开发时也会用低优化等级快速编译，只在发布时开高优化，兼顾效率和性能"}]},{"ID":"20260907141836-du6iush","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260907141836-du6iush","updated":"20260907142508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码编译的四个过程，每个阶段做了哪些事生成了什么文件"}]},{"ID":"20260907141836-3k01wgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907141836-3k01wgp","updated":"20260907141836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, 